<title>UK: Essen Hypo sets 3.0 bln mark four-year bond [CORRECTED 08:56 GMT].</title>
<headline>Essen Hypo sets 3.0 bln mark four-year bond [CORRECTED 08:56 GMT].</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers ABN AMRO Hoare Govett, Bayerische Hypothekenbank, Commerzbank, Deutsche Bank, Dresdner Bank, DG Bank, Norddeutsche Landesbank and HSBC Trinkaus.</p>
<p> BORROWER   HYPOTHEKENBANK IN ESSEN </p>
<p> AMT    3.0 BLN DEM   COUPON     4.0	 MATURITY    05.JAN.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  98.0	PAY DATE    08.JAN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  25 BP     REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    DDF	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 1-10	SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    6 BP	SELL CONC  19 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	OEFFENTLICHE PFRANDBRIEF EMISSION 451</p>
<p>(Lead manager corrects maturity from 08.JAN.01, issue price from 97.975, fees from 22.5 basis points and selling concession from 16.5 b.p.).</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
